#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3481)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreReceiptThought"
msgid "8월 2일이면 오빠가 없어진 뒤잖아."
msgstr "8月2日って、お兄ちゃんがいなくなった後じゃない。"

#. Key:	StoreTerminalCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3541)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3541)
