#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1054)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1054)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
