msgid "살펴보기"
msgstr "調べる"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardsThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1196)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1196)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardsThought"
msgid "벽에서 뜯어낸 판이야. 뒷면마다 방수 시트가 붙어 있어."
msgstr "壁から引きはがした板だ。どれも裏に防水シートが貼ってある。"

#. Key:	LeftoverHeapPrompt
