#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1202)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHeapThought"
msgid "방음재랑 방수 시트를 겹겹이 덧대 놨어. 철골까지 같이 붙어 있네."
msgstr "防音材と防水シートが何重にも貼ってある。鉄骨までくっついてる。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLedgerThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1235)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1235)
