msgstr "お兄ちゃんの名前まで書いておいて、持ち主なしだって。"

#. Key:	LeftoverInnerLockedPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1251)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1251)
