msgid "방수막째로 잘려 있네."
msgstr "防水シートごと切り取られてる。"

#. Key:	LeftoverPieceBStuck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1389)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1389)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverPieceBStuck"
msgid "뭔가에 눌려서 안 떨어져."
msgstr "何かに押さえつけられてて、はがれない。"

#. Key:	LeftoverPieceBThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1393)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1393)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverPieceBThought"
msgid "여기도 같은 조각이 있네."
msgstr "ここにも同じ破片がある。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGloveBoxThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1397)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1397)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGloveBoxThought"
msgid "202호 정우 씨 짐이네. 주인 없음 딱지가 붙어 있어."
msgstr "202号室のジョンウさんの荷物だ。持ち主なしのシールが貼ってある。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGlovesThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1405)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1405)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGlovesThought"
msgid "낮에 정우 씨한테 보여 주자."
msgstr "昼間、ジョンウさんに見せよう。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGlovesThought202
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1406)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1406)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGlovesThought202"
msgid "낮에 202호에 가져다주자."
msgstr "昼間、202号室に届けよう。"

#. Key:	P2ContradictionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1424)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1424)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P2ContradictionThought"
msgid "26일에 짐을 다 뺐다는데, 벽 두드리는 소리는 31일까지 났어. 그때도 위에 누가 있었던 거야."
msgstr "26日に荷物は全部運び出したっていうのに、壁を叩く音は31日まで続いてた。そのときも、上に誰かいたんだ。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWakeCreak
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1437)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1437)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWakeCreak"
msgid "[간이침대가 삐걱거리는 소리]"
msgstr "［簡易ベッドがきしむ音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverWakeSwitch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1445)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1445)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWakeSwitch"
msgid "[스위치 켜는 소리]"
msgstr "［スイッチを入れる音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverWakeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1446)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1446)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWakeThought"
msgid "아저씨가 깼어. 숨어야 해."
msgstr "管理人さんが起きた。隠れなきゃ。"

#. Key:	LeftoverErrandOut
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1490)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1490)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverErrandOut"
msgid "밖으로 나갔네. 안쪽 방 문이 열려 있어."
msgstr "外に出ていった。奥の部屋のドアが開いてる。"

#. Key:	LeftoverErrandBack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1500)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1500)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverErrandBack"
msgid "손수레 소리가 이쪽으로 와. 나가야 해."
msgstr "台車の音がこっちに来る。出なきゃ。"

#. Key:	N2ReturnThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1573)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1573)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,N2ReturnThought"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가야 해."
msgstr "あとは403号室に戻らないと。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1621)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1621)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticePrompt"
msgid "읽기"
msgstr "読む"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticeTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1623)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1623)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticeTitle"
msgid "대형 폐기물 수거 안내"
msgstr "粗大ごみ回収のお知らせ"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1625)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1625)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice1"
msgid "건물 안에 주인 없이 남은 짐을 한꺼번에 처리합니다."
msgstr "建物内に残された持ち主のいない荷物を、まとめて処分します。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1627)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1627)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice2"
msgid "수거일: 다음 주 월요일 오전 [두 줄 그어 지움]"
msgstr "回収日：来週月曜日の午前［二重線で消してある］"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1628)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1628)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice3"
msgid "이번 주 목요일 아침 7시 [볼펜 손글씨]"
msgstr "今週木曜日の朝7時［ボールペンの手書き］"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1630)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1630)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice4"
msgid "버릴 짐은 전날 밤까지 1층 주차장 안쪽에 내놓아 주세요."
msgstr "回収する荷物は前日の夜までに、1階駐車場の奥に出してください。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1631)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1631)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice5"
msgid "찾아갈 짐이 있으면 관리실에 말씀해 주세요.  -관리인"
msgstr "引き取りたい荷物がある方は、管理人室までお申し出ください。  -管理人"

#. Key:	LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1652)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1652)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt"
msgid "잡아 주기"
msgstr "押さえておく"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1669)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1669)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticeThought"
msgid "월요일이던 걸 목요일로 당겼어. 주인 없는 짐이라니, 누구 짐인데."
msgstr "月曜だったのを木曜に早めてる。持ち主のいない荷物って、じゃあ誰の荷物なの。"

#. Key:	LeftoverUnknownSender
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1721)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1721)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverUnknownSender"
msgid "202호"
msgstr "202号室"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooAlone
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1723)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1723)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooAlone"
msgid "새벽에 판이 갑자기 헐거워져서 겨우 밀고 나왔어요. 상자는 못 챙겼어요. 302호 혼자 가지 마세요."
msgstr "明け方、板が急に緩んだので、なんとか押しのけて出てこられました。箱は持ってこられませんでした。302号室にはひとりで行かないでください。"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooBoxAtDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1725)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1725)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooBoxAtDoor"
msgid "새벽엔 진짜 고마웠어요. 그 상자는 아침에 빼서 403호 문 앞에 뒀어요. 그 방엔 이제 혼자 들어가지 마세요."
msgstr "明け方は本当に助かりました。あの箱は朝のうちに出して、403号の前に置いておきました。もうあの部屋にひとりで行かないでください。"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooThanks
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1726)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1726)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooThanks"
msgid "새벽엔 진짜 고마웠어요. 짐은 아침에 제가 마저 뺐어요. 그 방엔 이제 혼자 들어가지 마세요."
msgstr "明け方は本当にありがとうございました。荷物の残りは、朝のうちに僕が出しておきました。あの部屋には、もうひとりで入らないでください。"

#. Key:	LeftoverTruckCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1747)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1747)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTruckCaption"
msgid "[골목 끝으로 멀어지는 트럭 엔진 소리]"
msgstr "［路地の先へ遠ざかっていくトラックのエンジン音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverEmptiedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1751)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1751)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverEmptiedThought"
msgid "다 실어 갔어. 끈이랑 찢긴 딱지만 남았네."
msgstr "全部持っていかれた。ひもと、破れたシールしか残ってない。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1833)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1833)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesIntro"
msgid "어, 어제 골목에서 뵌… 진짜 죄송했어요. 저 202호 정우예요."
msgstr "あ、昨日、路地でお会いした……本当にすみませんでした。202号室のジョンウです。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesHello
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1835)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1835)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesHello"
msgid "안녕하세요. 저 202호 사는 정우예요."
msgstr "こんにちは。202号室に住んでる、ジョンウです。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesAskDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1838)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1838)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesAskDoor"
msgid "저기, 죄송한데 문 좀 잡아 주실래요?"
msgstr "あの、すみません、ドアをちょっと押さえてもらえますか？"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesWhy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1850)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1850)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesWhy"
msgid "수거 날짜를 당겼대요. 내일 아침까지 여기다 모아 달라고요."
msgstr "回収の日を早めたそうです。明日の朝までに、ここに集めておいてくれって。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxesThanks
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1918)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1918)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxesThanks"
msgid "고마워요. 302호까지만 가면 돼요."
msgstr "ありがとうございます。302号室まで行けばいいんで。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGloves1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1977)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1977)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGloves1"
msgid "이거 제 건데요. 버리라고 한 적 없어요."
msgstr "これ、僕のです。捨てていいなんて言ってません。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGloves2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1978)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1978)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGloves2"
msgid "302호 짐에 더 섞여 있을지도 몰라요. 거기도 한번 봐요."
msgstr "302号室の荷物に、まだ混ざってるかもしれません。そっちも一度見てみてください。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGloves3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1979)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1979)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGloves3"
msgid "배달 끝나면 네 시쯤 돼요. 들어오는 길에 빼놓을게요."
msgstr "配達が終わると4時ごろになります。帰ってくるついでに出しておきますね。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoGloves1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1983)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1983)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoGloves1"
msgid "302호로 옮긴 짐에 제 겨울 장비도 섞여 있더라고요."
msgstr "302号室に運んだ荷物に、僕の冬装備も混じってたんですよ。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoGloves2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1984)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1984)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoGloves2"
msgid "302호에 더 있으면 같이 봐요."
msgstr "302号室にまだあるなら、一緒に見ましょう。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoGloves3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1985)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1985)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoGloves3"
msgid "배달 끝나면 네 시쯤 돼요. 들어오는 길에 빼놓을게요."
msgstr "配達が終わるのは4時ごろです。帰ってくるついでに出しておきます。"

#. Key:	LeftoverHomePouchPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(708)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(708)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHomePouchPrompt"
msgid "살펴보기"
msgstr "調べる"

#. Key:	LeftoverHomePouchHammer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(724)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(724)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHomePouchHammer"
msgid "고리 하나가 비어 있어. 5층에서 가져온 튜닝 해머가 꽂히던 자리야."
msgstr "輪っかがひとつ空いてる。5階から持ってきたチューニングハンマーを差してたところだ。"

#. Key:	LeftoverHomePouchEmpty
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(725)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(725)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHomePouchEmpty"
msgid "고리 하나가 비어 있어. 손잡이 긴 공구를 꽂던 자리야."
msgstr "輪っかがひとつ空いてる。柄の長い工具を差してたところだ。"

#. Key:	LeftoverMovedToLarge
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverMovedToLarge"
msgid "저리로 옮겨 갔어."
msgstr "あっちに移った。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1021)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1021)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedLine"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요."
msgstr "助かった……ありがとうございます。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1028)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1028)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedIntro"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요. 저 202호 정우예요."
msgstr "助かった……ありがとうございます。202号室のジョンウです。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedBoxLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1050)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1050)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedBoxLine"
msgid "그 상자… 아직 판 밑에 걸려 있어요."
msgstr "あの箱……まだ板の下に引っかかってます。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBraceAgain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1105)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1105)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBraceAgain"
msgid "상자요? 잠깐만요, 판 잡을게요."
msgstr "箱ですか？ちょっと待ってください、板を押さえます。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1130)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1130)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxStuck"
msgid "잠깐만요. 안 빠져요."
msgstr "待ってください。抜けないんです。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuckReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1131)
