msgid "읽기"
msgstr "読む"

#. Key:	ForumTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1003)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1003)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ForumTitle"
msgid "관리인께 드립니다"
msgstr "管理人様へ"

#. Key:	Forum1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1005)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1005)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum1"
msgid "6/30  새벽 네 시만 되면 위에서 뭘 질질 끕니다. 자다가 매번 깨요."
msgstr "6/30  明け方4時になると決まって、上で何かをずるずる引きずるんです。毎回それで目が覚めます。"

#. Key:	Forum2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1006)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1006)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum2"
msgid "7/12  관리인은 창고라 사람이 없대요. 그럼 이 소리는 어디서 나는 건가요?"
msgstr "7/12  管理人いわく、上は倉庫で人はいないそうです。じゃあ、この音はどこから出てるんですか？"

#. Key:	Forum3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1008)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1008)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum3"
msgid "7/26  03:12  어차피 네 시면 또 시작이에요. 오늘은 올라가 봅니다. 사람인지 뭔지 얼굴이나 보죠."
msgstr "7/26  03:12  どうせ4時になればまた始まります。今日は上に行ってみます。人なのか何なのか、顔くらい拝んでやりますよ。"

#. Key:	Forum4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1009)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1009)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum4"
msgid "댓글 12  ·  참지 마세요 / 잘 생각하셨어요 / 가서 확실하게 말하세요"
msgstr "コメント12  ·  我慢しなくていいですよ / それでいいと思います / 行ってはっきり言ってきてください"

#. Key:	JournalPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1036)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1036)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalPrompt"
msgid "읽기"
msgstr "読む"

#. Key:	JournalTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1038)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1038)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalTitle"
msgid "401호 황순금 소리 일지"
msgstr "401号室 ファン・スングム 音の日誌"

#. Key:	Journal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1040)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1040)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal1"
msgid "7/27  네 시 반쯤 또 깸. 위에서 다섯 번. 관리실 전화 안 받음."
msgstr "7/27  4時半ごろ、また目が覚める。上から五回。管理人室は電話に出ない。"

#. Key:	Journal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1041)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1041)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal2"
msgid "7/28  또 다섯 번. 어제보다 힘이 없음."
msgstr "7/28  また五回。昨日より力がない。"

#. Key:	Journal3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1042)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1042)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal3"
msgid "7/29  벽이 하도 울어서 나도 두드려 줬다. 저쪽이 하던 대로 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그랬더니 조용하데. 사람인가."
msgstr "7/29  壁があんまり鳴るので、私も叩いてやった。向こうがしてたとおり、二回、間を置いて、一回。そうしたら静かになった。人だろうか。"

#. Key:	Journal4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1043)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1043)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal4"
msgid "7/30  네 번 들음. 수도 틀자 안 들림."
msgstr "7/30  四回聞こえた。水道を出したら聞こえなくなった。"

#. Key:	Journal5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1044)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1044)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal5"
msgid "7/31  오늘은 세 번. 귀가 먹은 건지."
msgstr "7/31  今日は三回。耳が遠くなったのか。"

#. Key:	Journal6
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1046)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1046)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal6"
msgid "8/1"
msgstr "8/1"

