#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall1Named
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(127)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(127)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall1Named"
msgid "정우 씨가 302호에서 판에 끼었다고 했어."
msgstr "ジョンウさん、302号室で板に挟まったって言ってた。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(128)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(128)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall1"
msgid "302호 안에서 누가 판에 끼었다고 했어."
msgstr "302号室の中で、誰かが板に挟まったって言ってた。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(129)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(129)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall2"
msgid "302호에 들어가서 판이 어떻게 걸렸는지 보자."
msgstr "302号室に入って、板がどう引っかかってるか見てみよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(130)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(130)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall3"
msgid "3층 302호 문으로 들어가서 판 너머를 살펴보자."
msgstr "3階の302号室のドアから入って、板の向こうを調べよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace3Wedge
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace3Wedge"
msgid "쐐기는 장판 말고, 판 밑동이 철골 토막에 걸린 자리에 끼우자."
msgstr "楔は床材の上じゃなくて、板の根元が鉄骨の切れ端に引っかかってるところに差し込もう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace3Find
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace3Find"
msgid "문 옆에 쌓인 공사 자투리에서 받칠 걸 찾아서, 판 밑동이 철골 토막에 걸린 자리에 끼우자."
msgstr "ドアの横の工事くずから支えになるものを探して、板の根元が鉄骨の切れ端に引っかかってるところに差し込もう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(140)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(140)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen1"
msgid "판이 더 내려앉았어. 밑동이 밀렸어."
msgstr "板がもっと沈んだ。根元がずれた。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(141)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(141)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen2"
msgid "밑동을 받쳐 두면 판을 다시 세울 수 있을 거야."
msgstr "根元を支えておけば、板をもう一度立てられるはず。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen3Lift
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(143)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(143)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen3Lift"
msgid "쐐기가 받치고 있으니 판을 다시 세우자."
msgstr "楔が支えてるから、板をもう一度立てよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace1"
msgid "판 밑동부터 보자."
msgstr "まず板の根元を見よう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace2"
msgid "밑동이 밀리면 판이 더 넘어올 거야. 먼저 받쳐 두자."
msgstr "根元がずれたら、板がもっと倒れる。先に支えておこう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(158)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(158)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap2Seen"
msgid "관리실에선 큰 점검구를 여니까 그리로 옮겨 갔지."
msgstr "管理人室では、大きい点検口を開けたらそっちへ移っていった。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(159)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(159)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap2"
msgid "더 넓은 틈이 생기면 그리로 옮겨 갈지도 몰라."
msgstr "もっと広い隙間ができたら、そっちへ移るかもしれない。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(162)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(162)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap1"
msgid "벽에 붙은 게 판을 누르고 있어."
msgstr "壁に貼りついたものが、板を押してる。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap3Wardrobe
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(164)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(164)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap3Wardrobe"
msgid "장롱을 밀어서 뒤쪽 벽을 살펴보자."
msgstr "たんすを押して、後ろの壁を調べよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageHatch1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(166)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(166)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageHatch1"
msgid "장롱 뒤에 점검구가 있었어."
msgstr "たんすの後ろに点検口があった。"

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap3Hatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(168)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(168)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap3Hatch"
msgid "장롱 뒤 점검구를 열자. 판을 누르던 게 그리로 옮겨 가면 판이 풀릴 거야."
msgstr "たんすの後ろの点検口を開けよう。板を押してたものがそっちへ移れば、板が外れるはず。"

#. Key:	ArrivalContract1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract1"
msgid "책상 위에 계약서를 뒀지. 한번 읽어 보자."
msgstr "机に契約書があったよね。一度ちゃんと読んでおこう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalContract2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(178)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(178)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract2"
msgid "403호 책상 위 임대차계약서. 그거부터 보자."
msgstr "403号室の机にある賃貸借契約書。まずはそれを見よう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(185)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(185)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes1"
msgid "짐을 아직 다 안 풀었네."
msgstr "まだ荷ほどきが終わってない。"

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes2"
msgid "반송된 택배 상자, 조율 공구 상자, 예전 휴대폰 상자. 안 연 걸 열어 보자."
msgstr "返送された荷物の箱、調律の工具箱、古いスマホの箱。まだ開けてないのを開けてみよう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalStore1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(191)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(191)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore1"
msgid "편의점 사람이면 오빠를 봤을지도 몰라."
msgstr "コンビニの人なら、お兄ちゃんを見てるかもしれない。"

#. Key:	ArrivalStore2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(192)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(192)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore2"
msgid "편의점에 가서 물어보자. 1층에서 골목으로 나가면 돼."
msgstr "コンビニで聞いてみよう。1階から路地に出ればいい。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors1"
msgid "같은 층 다른 집도 한번 둘러보자."
msgstr "同じ階のほかの部屋も、ひと回りしてみよう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighborsBoth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(201)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(201)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighborsBoth"
msgid "401호는 문을 두드려 보고, 402호는 문에 붙은 메모를 읽어 보자."
msgstr "401号室はドアをノックして、402号室はドアに貼ってあるメモを読んでみよう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors401
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(203)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(203)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors401"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자. 누가 사는지는 알아야지."
msgstr "401号室のドアをノックしてみよう。誰が住んでるかくらいは知っておかないと。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors402
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(204)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(204)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors402"
msgid "402호 문에 붙은 메모를 아직 안 읽었네."
msgstr "402号室のドアに貼ってあるメモ、まだ読んでない。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(209)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(209)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof1"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 얘기가 있었는데."
msgstr "契約書に、屋上のことが書いてあったけど。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof2"
msgid "계단 끝까지 올라가서 옥상 문을 확인해 보자."
msgstr "階段を一番上まで上がって、屋上の扉を確かめてみよう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep1"
msgid "오늘은 이만 자자."
msgstr "今日はもう寝よう。"

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(214)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(214)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep2"
msgid "403호 침대에 눕자. 알람은 네 시 반에 맞춰 뒀어."
msgstr "403号室のベッドで横になろう。アラームは午前4時半にセットしてある。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Dial
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(223)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(223)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Dial"
msgid "복도등을 끄고, 이름표 없는 차단기를 내렸다 올리면서 다섯 번째 원판을 보자."
msgstr "廊下の電気を消して、ラベルのないブレーカーを落としたり上げたりしながら、5番目の円盤を見よう。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Sheet
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Sheet"
msgid "검침 기록지에 계량기 다섯 개가 다 적혀 있는지 보자."
msgstr "検針記録に、五つのメーターが全部載っているか見よう。"

#. Key:	NightOne3Breaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Breaker"
msgid "이름표 없는 차단기를 올려 둔 채로 원판을 한 번 더 보자."
msgstr "ラベルのないブレーカーを上げたまま、もう一度円盤を見よう。"

#. Key:	NightOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne1"
msgid "위에 누가 있으면 전기를 쓰겠지. 1층 계량기함을 봐야겠다."
msgstr "上に誰かいるなら、電気を使ってるはず。1階のメーターボックスを見てみよう。"

#. Key:	NightOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(229)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(229)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne2"
msgid "계량기가 집마다 하나씩인지 세어 보자. 복도등을 꺼도 도는 게 있으면 다른 데로 전기가 가는 거야."
msgstr "メーターが一部屋に一つずつか数えてみよう。廊下の電気を消しても回ってるのがあったら、別の場所に電気が流れてるってこと。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Carbon
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Carbon"
msgid "연필로 접수철 밑장을 끝까지 문질러 보자."
msgstr "受付票の綴りの下の紙を、鉛筆で端から端までこすってみよう。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Agent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Agent"
msgid "관리실 책상 위 부동산 문자 출력본도 읽어 보자."
msgstr "管理人室の机にある不動産屋のメッセージの印刷も読んでみよう。"

#. Key:	NightTwo3Desk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Desk"
msgid "관리실 책상을 한 번 더 둘러보자."
msgstr "管理人室の机を、もう一度よく見てみよう。"

#. Key:	NightTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(245)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(245)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo1"
msgid "소음 민원이 들어갔다면 관리실에 기록이 남았겠지."
msgstr "騒音の苦情が出てたなら、管理人室に記録が残ってるはず。"

#. Key:	NightTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(246)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(246)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo2"
msgid "민원 대장이랑 접수철을 같이 보자. 접수철 밑장에 눌린 자국이 남았을지도."
msgstr "苦情台帳と受付票の綴りを見比べよう。綴りの下の紙に筆圧の跡が残ってるかも。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(255)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(255)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner1"
msgid "아저씨가 자리를 비우면 안쪽 방을 봐야 해."
msgstr "管理人さんが席を外したら、奥の部屋を見ておかないと。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(256)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(256)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner2"
msgid "안쪽 방에 뭐가 있는지 하나씩 살펴보자."
msgstr "奥の部屋に何があるか、一つずつ見てみよう。"

#. Key:	NightTwoInner3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner3"
msgid "아저씨가 돌아오기 전에 관리실을 나가자."
msgstr "管理人さんが戻ってくる前に、管理人室を出よう。"

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(265)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(265)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit1"
msgid "관리실에서 403호까지 돌아오는 길이 남았어."
msgstr "管理人室から403号室まで戻る道が残ってる。"

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(266)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(266)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit2"
msgid "1층 관리실에 다시 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "1階の管理人室にもう一度寄ってから、403号室に戻ろう。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가야 해."
msgstr "もう403号室に戻らないと。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(271)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(271)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn2"
msgid "계단으로 올라가서 403호 안까지. 발소리를 줄이자."
msgstr "階段で上がって、403号室の中まで。足音を抑えよう。"

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(272)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(272)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn3"
msgid "쫓아오면 뛰어서라도 403호 안으로 들어가자."
msgstr "追ってきたら、走ってでも403号室に駆け込もう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(285)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(285)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가자."
msgstr "もう403号室に戻ろう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(286)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(286)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn2"
msgid "아까 벽에 그 박자로 두드리니까 다 조용해졌어. 복도에서도 통할까."
msgstr "さっき壁をあのリズムで叩いたら、全部静かになった。廊下でも通じるかな。"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(287)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(287)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn3"
msgid "복도에서 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 두드리고, 멈춘 사이에 403호로 들어가자."
msgstr "廊下で二回、間を置いて、一回ノックして、止まっている間に403号室に入ろう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(298)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(298)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm1"
msgid "오빠가 문 두드리던 박자가 있었는데."
msgstr "お兄ちゃんがドアをノックするときのリズム、あったよね。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(299)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(299)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm2"
msgid "음성 메시지에서 그랬잖아. “문 두드리면 알지? 둘, 하나.”"
msgstr "留守電で言ってた。「ノックでわかるよな？ 二回、一回。」"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(301)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(301)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에서 그 박자를 찾아보자."
msgstr "調律の手帳で、あのリズムを探してみよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(302)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(302)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그 박자로 비어 있는 벽을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "二回、間を置いて、一回。そのリズムで、中が空洞の壁をノックしてみよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey1"
msgid "옥상 문을 열 열쇠가 있어야 해."
msgstr "屋上の扉を開ける鍵がいる。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(311)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(311)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey2"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었지."
msgstr "管理人室の机の上に、鍵束があったよね。"

#. Key:	NightThreeKey3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(312)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(312)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey3"
msgid "1층 관리실에서 열쇠 꾸러미를 챙겨서 옥상으로 올라가자."
msgstr "1階の管理人室で鍵束を取って、屋上に上がろう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(328)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(328)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor1"
msgid "옥상부터 둘러보자."
msgstr "まず屋上を見て回ろう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(329)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(329)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor2"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 창고 얘기가 있었지. 그 문부터 찾아보자."
msgstr "契約書に屋上の倉庫の話があったよね。その扉から探してみよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(330)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(330)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor3"
msgid "열쇠 꾸러미의 창고 열쇠로 그 철문을 열자."
msgstr "鍵束の倉庫の鍵で、あの鉄の扉を開けよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(333)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(333)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall1"
msgid "벽마다 소리가 다른지 들어 보자."
msgstr "壁ごとに音が違うか、聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Criterion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(335)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(335)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Criterion"
msgid "수첩에 적혀 있었지. 빈 곳은 낮게 울리고 소리가 오래 간다고."
msgstr "手帳に書いてあった。空洞のところは低く響いて、音が長く残るって。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(336)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(336)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩을 읽어 보자. 오빠도 이 벽을 살펴봤을까."
msgstr "調律の手帳を読もう。お兄ちゃんも、この壁を調べたのかな。"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(337)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(337)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall3"
msgid "배관 밸브를 열고 벽마다 귀를 대 보자. 아니면 하나씩 두드려서 어디가 오래 울리는지 들어 보자."
msgstr "配管のバルブを開けて、壁ごとに耳を当ててみよう。それか一つずつノックして、どこが長く響くか聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Drain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(345)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(345)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Drain"
msgid "옥상 물탱크 배수 밸브부터 열자."
msgstr "まず、屋上の貯水槽の排水バルブを開けよう。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Bypass
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(347)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(347)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Bypass"
msgid "다음은 옥상 우회 밸브야."
msgstr "次は屋上のバイパスバルブ。"

#. Key:	NightFour3Pump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(348)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(348)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Pump"
msgid "마지막으로 1층 관리실 펌프를 손으로 돌리자."
msgstr "最後に、1階の管理人室の揚水ポンプを手動で動かそう。"

#. Key:	NightFour1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(350)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(350)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour1"
msgid "망치 소리가 너무 클 텐데. 좀 덜 들리게 할 수 없을까."
msgstr "金づちの音は響くよね。少しでも紛らわせられないかな。"

#. Key:	NightFour2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(351)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(351)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour2"
msgid "물탱크 물을 빼면 배관이 시끄럽겠지. 관리실에 점검 메모 같은 게 있을지도."
msgstr "貯水槽の水を抜いたら、配管がうるさくなるはず。管理人室に点検メモみたいなのがあるかも。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(365)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(365)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0a"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 뜯어야 해."
msgstr "水の音がしている間に、壁をはがさないと。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(366)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(366)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0b"
msgid "가운데 칸에만 판을 한 겹 더 댔어. 고정한 데를 찾자."
msgstr "真ん中の区画だけ、板がもう一枚重ねてある。留めてあるところを探そう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall0c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(367)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(367)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0c"
msgid "위쪽 덧판 이음매를 망치로 치자. 테이프 밑에 나사가 있을 거야."
msgstr "上の当て板の継ぎ目を金づちで叩こう。テープの下にネジがあるはず。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(370)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(370)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1a"
msgid "그게 이음매를 덮고 있어."
msgstr "あれが継ぎ目を覆ってる。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(371)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(371)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1b"
msgid "더 넓은 틈을 내주면 그리로 옮겨 갈까."
msgstr "もっと広い隙間を開けてやったら、そっちに移るかな。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(372)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(372)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1c"
msgid "구석 쪽 작은 덧판을 떼어 내자. 밑이 넓게 뚫려 있으면 그리로 옮겨 갈 거야."
msgstr "隅の小さな当て板をはがそう。下に大きな穴が開いてたら、そっちに移るはず。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Ba
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(376)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(376)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Ba"
msgid "틀에 걸려서 몸을 못 접네."
msgstr "枠に引っかかって、体を折りたためないんだ。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bb
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(377)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(377)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bb"
msgid "이음매 위로 나사가 드러나 있었지."
msgstr "継ぎ目の上に、ネジがむき出しになってたよね。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(378)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(378)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bc"
msgid "드러난 덧판 나사를 망치로 쳐 내자."
msgstr "むき出しになった当て板のネジを、金づちで叩いて外そう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(380)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(380)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2a"
msgid "천장까지 몸을 폈어. 다시 접히면 벽으로 와."
msgstr "天井まで体を広げた。また折りたたんだら、壁のほうに来る。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(382)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(382)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2b"
msgid "구석에 철골 틀이 있었어."
msgstr "隅に鉄骨の枠があった。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2bUnseen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(383)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(383)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2bUnseen"
msgid "저 마디를 걸어 둘 만한 게 이 층에 없을까. 둘러보자."
msgstr "あの関節を引っかけておけるもの、この階にないかな。見て回ろう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(384)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(384)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2c"
msgid "구석에 기대 둔 철골 틀을 점검구 앞에 세워서 저 무릎 마디를 걸자."
msgstr "隅に立てかけてある鉄骨の枠を点検口の前に立てて、あの膝の関節を引っかけよう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(388)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(388)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3a"
msgid "틀이 밀렸어."
msgstr "枠がずれた。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(389)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(389)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3b"
msgid "저게 버티면서 틀을 밀고 있어."
msgstr "あれが踏ん張って、枠を押してる。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(390)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(390)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3c"
msgid "밀린 틀을 다시 세우자."
msgstr "ずれた枠を立て直そう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ia
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(392)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(392)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ia"
msgid "덧판은 떼어 냈어. 안쪽 판이 남았어."
msgstr "当て板ははがした。内側の板が残ってる。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ib
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(393)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(393)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ib"
msgid "기둥을 따라 안쪽 판에도 나사가 박혀 있어."
msgstr "内側の板は、柱に沿ってネジで留めてある。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ic
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(394)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(394)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ic"
msgid "양쪽 기둥 자리의 나사를 쳐 내자."
msgstr "両側の柱のところのネジを、叩いて外そう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(397)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(397)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4a"
msgid "거의 다 됐어."
msgstr "もう少しだ。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(398)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(398)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4b"
msgid "위에 철물 하나가 남았어."
msgstr "上に金具がひとつ残ってる。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall4c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(399)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(399)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4c"
msgid "위쪽 가운데 ㄱ자 철물을 쳐 내자."
msgstr "上の真ん中にあるL字金具を叩いて外そう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(405)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(405)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 쳐야 해."
msgstr "水の音がしている間に、壁を叩かないと。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(406)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(406)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2"
msgid "낮에 사 온 망치가 있잖아. 5층 벽 앞으로 가자."
msgstr "昼に金づちを買ってきたんだった。5階の壁の前に行こう。"

#. Key:	NightFourWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(407)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(407)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3"
msgid "물소리가 날 때 5층 가운데 벽을 망치로 치자. 구멍이 날 때까지."
msgstr "水の音がしている間に、5階の真ん中の壁を金づちで叩こう。穴が開くまで。"

#. Key:	NightFourReveal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(412)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(412)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal1"
msgid "벽 안을 봐야 해."
msgstr "壁の中を見ないと。"

#. Key:	NightFourReveal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(413)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(413)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal2"
msgid "손전등으로 벽 안쪽을 비춰 보자."
msgstr "壁の中を懐中電灯で照らしてみよう。"

#. Key:	NightFourChoice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(416)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(416)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice1"
msgid "오빠 곁에 가 보자."
msgstr "お兄ちゃんのそばに行こう。"

#. Key:	NightFourChoice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(417)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(417)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice2"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 갈까. 아니면 녹음을 끄고 조금 더 있을까."
msgstr "チューニングハンマーをお兄ちゃんのそばに置いて帰ろうか。それとも録音を止めて、もう少しここにいようか。"

#. Key:	DayOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(428)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(428)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne1"
msgid "401호 할머니는 이 건물에 오래 사셨잖아."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさん、この建物に長く住んでるんだよね。"

#. Key:	DayOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(429)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(429)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려서 여쭤보자."
msgstr "401号室のドアをノックして、話を聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayOne3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(430)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(430)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne3"
msgid "밤에는 1층 관리실에 가서 소음 민원 기록부터 보자."
msgstr "夜は1階の管理人室に行って、まず騒音の苦情の記録を見よう。"

#. Key:	DayOneMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(432)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(432)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤에 계량기함을 끝까지 못 봤어."
msgstr "昨夜はメーターボックスを最後まで調べられなかった。"

#. Key:	DayOneMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(433)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(433)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんに聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayOneMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(434)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(434)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed3"
msgid "밤이 오면 1층 계량기함부터 보자."
msgstr "夜になったら、まず1階のメーターボックスを見よう。"

#. Key:	DayTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(438)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(438)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo1"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤볼까."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんに聞いてみようかな。"

#. Key:	DayTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(439)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(439)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "401号室のドアをノックしてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayTwo3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(440)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(440)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo3"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었어. 그걸로 옥상 문을 열 수 있겠다."
msgstr "管理人室の机の上に鍵束があった。あれで屋上の扉を開けられそう。"

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(442)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(442)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤에 놓친 게 있어. 다시 가 봐야겠어."
msgstr "昨夜、見落としたことがある。もう一度行かないと。"

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(443)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(443)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんに聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(444)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(444)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 관리실에 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "夜になったら、管理人室に寄ってから403号室に戻ろう。"

#. Key:	DayThreePolice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(449)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreePolice1"
msgid "경찰이 온다고 했어."
msgstr "警察が来るって言ってた。"

#. Key:	DayThreePolice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(450)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(450)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreePolice2"
msgid "옥상으로 올라가서 5층 철문 안에서 기다리자."
msgstr "屋上に上がって、5階の鉄の扉の中に入って待とう。"

#. Key:	DayThreeNotice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(456)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(456)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeNotice1"
msgid "4층 복도를 한번 둘러보자."
msgstr "4階の廊下をひと回りしてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayThreeNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(457)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(457)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeNotice2"
msgid "엘리베이터 옆에 새로 붙은 종이를 읽어 보자."
msgstr "エレベーターの横に新しく貼られた紙を読んでみよう。"

#. Key:	DayThree1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(461)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(461)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree1"
msgid "할머니께 말씀드려야겠어."
msgstr "おばあさんに伝えておかないと。"

#. Key:	DayThree2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(462)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(462)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "401号室のドアをノックしてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayThree3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(463)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(463)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree3"
msgid "볼일을 마치면 403호에서 좀 쉬자. 밤에 다시 올라가야 해."
msgstr "用事が済んだら、403号室で少し休もう。夜にはまた上に行かないと。"

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(465)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(465)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 끝까지 못 갔어."
msgstr "昨夜は最後までたどり着けなかった。"

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(466)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(466)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんに聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(467)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(467)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 5층 벽 앞까지 가 보자."
msgstr "夜になったら、5階の壁の前まで行ってみよう。"

#. Key:	DayOther1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(470)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(470)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOther1"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "401号室のおばあさんに聞いてみよう。"

#. Key:	NightOneAfter1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(511)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(511)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOneAfter1"
msgid "위에서 형광등 소리가 났어."
msgstr "上から蛍光灯の音がした。"

#. Key:	NightOneAfter2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(512)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(512)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOneAfter2"
msgid "소리가 계단 위쪽에서 내려왔어. 4층 복도 천장 쪽이겠지."
msgstr "音は階段の上から降りてきた。4階の廊下の天井のあたりかな。"

#. Key:	NightOneAfter3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(513)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(513)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOneAfter3"
msgid "4층 복도 천장 밑에서 소리를 들어 보자. 그다음엔 403호 침대에서 쉬어도 돼."
msgstr "4階の廊下の天井の下で、音を聞いてみよう。そのあとは403号室のベッドで休んでいい。"

#. Key:	NightRest1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(516)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(516)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightRest1"
msgid "오늘은 이쯤 하자."
msgstr "今夜はこのくらいにしておこう。"

#. Key:	NightRest2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(517)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(517)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightRest2"
msgid "더 볼 데가 남았으면 마저 보고, 아니면 이제 쉬자."
msgstr "まだ見るところが残ってたら見ておいて、なければもう休もう。"

#. Key:	NightRest3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(518)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(518)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightRest3"
msgid "403호 침대에서 아침까지 쉬자. 밖이 조용할 때."
msgstr "403号室のベッドで朝まで休もう。外が静かなときに。"

#. Key:	AssemblyFit1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(67)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(67)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyFit1"
msgid "틀 귀퉁이에 고정쇠가 있네. 조각을 여기에 거는 건가."
msgstr "枠の隅に留め金がある。ここに破片を引っかけるのかな。"

#. Key:	AssemblyFit2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(68)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(68)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyFit2"
msgid "조각 뒷면을 보자. 고정쇠가 물릴 구멍이 있을 거야."
msgstr "破片の裏を見てみよう。留め金がかかる穴があるはず。"

#. Key:	AssemblyFit3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(69)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(69)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyFit3"
msgid "구멍이 위로 오게 조각을 뒤집고, 고정쇠에 맞춰 돌려 보자. 긴 조각은 긴 칸에."
msgstr "穴が上になるように裏返して、留め金に合う向きに回そう。長い破片は長い枠に。"

#. Key:	AssemblyFlip1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(73)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(73)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyFlip1"
msgid "다 맞췄어. 앞면은 어떻게 생겼을까."
msgstr "全部はまった。表はどうなってるんだろう。"

#. Key:	AssemblyFlip2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(74)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(74)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyFlip2"
msgid "맞춘 덮개를 뒤집어 보자."
msgstr "組んだふたを裏返してみよう。"

#. Key:	AssemblyMembrane1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(78)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(78)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyMembrane1"
msgid "얼룩 한쪽에 방수막이 덧대져 있어."
msgstr "しみの一部に防水シートが当ててある。"

#. Key:	AssemblyMembrane2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(79)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(79)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyMembrane2"
msgid "방수막을 들춰 보자."
msgstr "防水シートをめくってみよう。"

#. Key:	AssemblyTake1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(83)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(83)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblyTake1"
msgid "덮개를 챙겨서 어디에 붙어 있던 건지 찾아보자."
msgstr "このふた、どこについてたんだろう。持っていこう。"

#. Key:	AssemblySite1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(87)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(87)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblySite1"
msgid "덮개 틀 날개에 구멍이 네 개 있었지."
msgstr "ふたの枠のふちに、穴が四つあったよね。"

#. Key:	AssemblySite2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(88)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(88)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblySite2"
msgid "이 덧판에도 나사 네 개가 네모나게 박혀 있어. 자리가 같을까."
msgstr "この当て板にも、四角く打たれたネジが四本ある。位置が同じかな。"

#. Key:	AssemblySite3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(89)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(89)
msgctxt "IGHint,AssemblySite3"
msgid "덧판 앞에 덮개를 대 보자."
msgstr "当て板の前に、ふたを当ててみよう。"

#. Key:	YudamBatteryChanged
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(185)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(185)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamBatteryChanged"
msgid "이걸로 좀 버티겠지."
msgstr "これでしばらく持つかな。"

#. Key:	YudamFlashlightLowSpare
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(327)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(327)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamFlashlightLowSpare"
msgid "불빛이 약해졌어. 잠깐 끄고 건전지를 갈자."
msgstr "光が弱くなってきた。一度消して電池を替えよう。"

#. Key:	YudamFlashlightLow
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(328)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(328)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamFlashlightLow"
msgid "불빛이 약해졌어. 건전지가 다 돼 가나 봐."
msgstr "光が弱くなってきた。電池が切れかけてるのかも。"

